{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17218020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721802001:1":{"text":"하암... 일어났나요?","source_cn":"啊哈……你醒啦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10AB3DA694FD49C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721802002:1":{"text":"승리한 모양이군요. 당신의 영혼 파동이... 음, 아주 밝고 단단해졌어요.","source_cn":"看来你战胜了那个大家伙呢。你的灵魂波动变得……唔，很亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CD5C911F56FDE2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721802003:1":{"text":"...네.","source_cn":"……是的，冕下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E42E70469429459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721802004:1":{"text":"“거대한 드래곤”은... 사실 제 내면의 나약함이었네요.","source_cn":"我看到了……那个所谓“真实的巨龙”，其实就是我自己内心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC97CDEC4FF179EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721802005:1":{"text":"하지만 이겨냈어요.","source_cn":"但我已经击败了它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x315BBDA494719889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721802006:1":{"text":"느낌이 어떤가요?","source_cn":"感觉如何？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D68540E21E9A148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721802007:1":{"text":"최고예요... 지금까지 이런 적 없을 정도로요.","source_cn":"感觉……前所未有的好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA092CE178EECAEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721802008:1":{"text":"활을 쥔 손에 더 이상 망설임이 없고, 마음속의 잡음도 사라졌어요. 이제 제가 무엇을 해야 하는지 분명히 알게 되었죠.","source_cn":"握弓的手不再犹豫，心里的杂音也消失了。我现在很清楚自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523C6A7AB8AFA4EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721802009:1":{"text":"아로라 님, 도와주셔서 감사해요. 이 꿈으로 활 솜씨보다 더 중요한 것을 되찾을 수 있었어요.","source_cn":"奥萝菈冕下，感谢您的援手。这场梦境让我找回了比箭术更重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1871F0417CB74059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721802010:1":{"text":"음... 고맙다는 말은 안 해도 돼요...","source_cn":"唔……不用谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x641FD9D5D37B0A72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721802011:1":{"text":"그럼... 아발론으로 돌아가서... 자야겠어요...","source_cn":"那我也回阿瓦隆……补觉了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407C625B088DBDD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721802012:0":{"text":"(나도 내가 있어야 할 전장으로 떠나야겠어. 주둔지로 돌아가 장비를 정리하고 바로 출발하자.)","source_cn":"我也该奔赴我要去的战场了……接下来，回到驻地整理行装直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC65574FF6884BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721802013:1":{"text":"(아버지께는... 공을 세우고 돌아온 뒤에 인사해야지.)","source_cn":"父亲那里……等我带着战功回来再向他致意吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BA7F7B1221409BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奥萝菈":{"text":"아로라","source":"奥萝菈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17218030.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1721803001:0":{"text":"곧바로 출발할 수 있게 군마에게 사료를 줘야겠어.","source_cn":"先喂喂战马吧，待会就可以直接出发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44FBF2D55DE1B47B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17218040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721804001:1":{"text":"재키, 스톰의 사료를 두 배로 늘리고 발굽도 점검해 줘. 곧 출발해야 하니까 최고의 상태로 유지해 두어야...","source_cn":"约翰，帮我给风暴喂双份的草料，再检查一下马蹄铁。我需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8037F23419CF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721804002:1":{"text":"좋은 아침입니다, 아가씨... 아니, 분대장님. 스톰은 최고급 검은콩과 귀리로 배부르게 먹여 두었으니 걱정 마시지요.","source_cn":"早安，大小姐……哦不，格温妮丝队长。您不用急，风暴已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE503007841D23D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721804003:1":{"text":"발굽도 어제 새것으로 갈아 두었고, 안장도 제가 올려두었습니다.","source_cn":"马蹄铁昨晚刚换了新的，马鞍我也帮您装好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70471DB3233B3834","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721804004:2":{"text":"벌써? 나... 멀리 간다고 말한 적 없었는데.","source_cn":"喂好了？我没有提前通知我要……出远门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB743F64289EB5FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721804005:2":{"text":"군마 곁으로 다가간 귀네스는 안장 양옆의 짐이 불룩하게 채워져 있는 것을 발견했다. 심지어 예비 화살통까지 가장 손에 잘 닿는 위치에 걸려